% a year.","That works out to $7.1M of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $5.3M (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $160K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":66,"head":"Avoid: priced 114% above its fair value of $11.48.","pros":["FCF margin 18.8%","Revenue grew 30.4%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.3x","P/E 18.2x vs sector 23.6x","EV/EBITDA 12.3x vs sector 16.3x"],"cons":["Trades 114% above fair value of $11.48"],"flags":["Priced 114% above its fair value of $11.48"],"need":[],"buy_below":9.76,"vc":{"base":11.48,"base_src":"dcf","bear":8.16,"bull":16.07,"alt_median":10.75,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.0719,"dispersion":0.0349,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":23.5593,"ev_ebitda":16.316,"pfcf":17.832,"pb":1.3568,"roic":0.0411,"gross_margin":0.5765,"fcf_margin":0.1733,"div_yield":0.0479}},"ticker":"HST","date":"2026-11-06"}